        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Mose guri báy, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.7.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.7.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 7:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Xoorór Israeli ádbaweek, umuúqo heewo oo ilahhooár wayda ga gaas, aqo inósuú kilá' bartaka gan huuw amór AAKOÓ MUNGÚ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.7.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.7.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 7:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngin dabaawós awa kilár huuw tawa adór ilahhooár da/a, nee di/i nee da/eewo, gari gáwtí tlees as ngiwa haniís dír AAKOÓ MUNGÚ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.7.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.7.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 7:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaahamusmoó Mungú wahana gari daa/ gawaá kitángw ilahhooa, ala fu'unaá da/eewo awa Aroni nee daaqaywós. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.7.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.7.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 7:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaaér doó /iyáy ar alu ar sleedár ilahhooár wayda an kaahamusmoó Mungú i hanisá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.7.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.7.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 7:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaaeedá' tari ar kaahamusmoó Mungú oo xwaylár Aroni, kudá' tseerér ilahhooár wayda nee wahhnaaro gi hanmamiís. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.7.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.7.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 7:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ da/eewodá' taa haniís tawa ilahhooár ta gáwtí tleemisi nee yaaeedá' taa ilahhooár wa haniisi baraá ilahhooar'ín tidár wayduwo, aga hara'ayiím múk Israeli ngiwa haniisi dír kaahamusmo Aroni nee xwaylarós. Asma fu'unayká' kina dír kaahamuusér Mungú ii haniís ay alhhe'eesay wasle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.7.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.7.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 7:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muruuwí kuna paraátl as Aroni nee xwaylarós baraá ilahhooadár da/a ta hanmiisi dír AAKOÓ MUNGÚ iimír bál kiwa kaahamuusér AAKOÓ MUNGÚ wa qaás. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.7.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.7.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 7:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bál kiwa paraátl, kiri iimbalaáx ar di/i, AAKOÓ MUNGÚ xoorór Israeli gana hara'ayín baraá ilahhooar'ín tidár da/to muruuwí kuwa hanmiisi dír kaahamuuse tawa gar'ín kureerisleém baraá qari sleémeero.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.7.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.7.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
